<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>BRANCHES 챕터 퀴즈</title>
    <meta name="description" content="초록빛 사이버 배경의 BRANCHES 챕터별 보안 퀴즈 화면입니다." />
    <link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 64 64'%3E%3Crect width='64' height='64' rx='14' fill='%2306110b'/%3E%3Cpath d='M16 33h17c8 0 15-7 15-15' fill='none' stroke='%2334f26b' stroke-width='7' stroke-linecap='round'/%3E%3Cpath d='M16 47h17c8 0 15-7 15-15' fill='none' stroke='%239dffb5' stroke-width='7' stroke-linecap='round'/%3E%3C/svg%3E" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="./assets/branches-lab.css" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="app-shell">
      <header class="top-bar" aria-label="주요 메뉴">
        <div>
          <a class="brand-mark" href="#home" aria-label="BRANCHES 홈">
            <span class="brand-icon" aria-hidden="true">⌁</span>
            <span>BRANCHES</span>
          </a>

          <nav class="icon-nav" aria-label="상단 메뉴">
          <button class="nav-icon" type="button" data-label="홈" aria-label="홈">
            <span aria-hidden="true">🏠</span>
            <span class="nav-tooltip" aria-hidden="true">홈</span>
          </button>
          <button class="nav-icon" type="button" data-label="사용자 관리" aria-label="사용자 관리">
            <span aria-hidden="true">👤</span>
            <span class="nav-tooltip" aria-hidden="true">사용자 관리</span>
          </button>
          <button class="nav-icon" type="button" data-label="친구" aria-label="친구">
            <span aria-hidden="true">🧑‍🤝‍🧑</span>
            <span class="nav-tooltip" aria-hidden="true">친구</span>
          </button>
          <button class="nav-icon" type="button" data-label="설정" aria-label="설정">
            <span aria-hidden="true">⚙️</span>
            <span class="nav-tooltip" aria-hidden="true">설정</span>
          </button>
          </nav>
        </div>
      </header>

      <main id="home" class="main-stage">
        <section class="hero-panel" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
          <div>
            <p class="eyebrow">GREEN BASE TRAINING</p>
            <h1 id="hero-title">챕터를 선택하고 문제를 해결하세요</h1>
            <p class="hero-copy">
              챕터에 들어가면 10개의 문제가 순서대로 표시됩니다. 정답을 맞히면 다음 문제로 넘어가고,
              틀리면 같은 문제에서 다시 시도합니다.
            </p>
          </div>
          <aside class="status-card" aria-live="polite">
            <span class="status-label">현재 진행</span>
            <strong id="progressText">챕터를 선택하세요</strong>
            <div class="progress-track" aria-hidden="true"><div id="progressFill" class="progress-fill"></div></div>
          </aside>
        </section>

        <section id="chapterSelect" class="chapter-section" aria-labelledby="chapter-title">
          <div class="section-title">
            <p class="eyebrow">CHAPTER SELECT</p>
            <h2 id="chapter-title">학습 챕터</h2>
          </div>
          <div id="chapterGrid" class="chapter-grid"></div>
        </section>

        <section id="quizPanel" class="quiz-panel" aria-labelledby="quizTitle" hidden>
          <div class="quiz-topline">
            <button id="backToChapters" class="ghost-button" type="button">← 챕터 선택으로</button>
            <span id="questionCounter" class="counter-pill">1 / 10</span>
          </div>

          <div class="quiz-card">
            <p id="chapterName" class="eyebrow">CHAPTER</p>
            <h2 id="quizTitle">문제 제목</h2>
            <p id="questionText" class="question-text"></p>

            <form id="answerForm" class="answer-form">
              <label for="answerInput">정답 입력</label>
              <div class="answer-row">
                <input id="answerInput" name="answer" autocomplete="off" placeholder="정답을 입력하세요" />
                <button class="action-button" type="submit">확인</button>
              </div>
              <p id="feedback" class="feedback" aria-live="polite"></p>
            </form>
          </div>
        </section>
      </main>
    </div>

    <script type="module" src="./assets/branches-lab.js"></script>
  </body>
</html>
